## std.opus.5-6: SILK, hybrid and the switches between modes. The packets
## are libopus 1.5.2 encodings of synthetic tones (made with PyAV; no licence
## attached). The expected samples, every 53rd of the interleaved int16
## output, come from a Python model of RFC 6716 §4.2 and §4.5 that matches
## libopus exactly for SILK and within 1 LSB for hybrid.
